<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7972] NPE in TTL manager.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7972</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;TTL manager can try to evict expired entries on cache that wasn&apos;t initialized yet due to a race.&lt;br/&gt;
This lead to NPE in unwindEvicts method.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;PFA stacktrace.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
